            "block_content": "where $f(t)$ is an arbitrary function defined in time domain and $d_{ij}$ is light travel time along $L_{ij}$. If the rate of change in armlength $\\dot{d}_{ij}$ is negligible, the delay operator, as its name suggests, acts as a time delay transformation.",
